  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You stand indefatigable and unmoved in the face of life’s mightiest trials and tribulations.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Stoic<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +2 bonus on all saving throws against fear and emotion effects. If you successfully save against any fear or emotion effect, you are unaffected by that effect (even if it normally has a partial effect on a successful save).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc86\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
